# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Oasis PrimeKG packages: model weights, prepared graph tables, the vendored
# original source and the bundled dependency tree. Together about 9 GB, with
# single files above GitHub's 100 MB limit, so they are delivered with the
# skill package itself (see each skill's README), not through git. Only the
# editable part of the Skill is tracked here: SKILL.md, manifest, docs,
# scripts, src and the small examples.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
skills/Device/Oasis/.claude/skills/primekg-cgi-drug-effect-prediction/primekg_cgi_graph_graph_only_e50/
skills/Device/Oasis/.claude/skills/primekg-cgi-drug-effect-prediction/model_source/
skills/Device/Oasis/.claude/skills/primekg-cgi-drug-effect-prediction/runtime_deps/
skills/Device/Oasis/.claude/skills/primekg-cgi-drug-effect-prediction/source_archives/
skills/Device/Oasis/.claude/skills/combination-efficacy-prediction/output/
skills/Device/Oasis/.claude/skills/combination-efficacy-prediction/data/disease-gene.csv

